section#about
	.wrapper
		.section-heading.reveal-on-scroll
			span.section-heading__tag 01. Profile
			h2.section-heading__title
				| About 
				span.highlight Me
			p.section-heading__subtitle
				| Designing reliable frontend architectures and engineering seamless digital experiences.

		.about-container
			.about-sidebar.reveal-on-scroll
				.avatar-wrapper
					.avatar-wrapper__box
						img(src="images/avatar.jpg", alt="Anton Cherepov")
					.avatar-wrapper__badge
						span.status-dot
						span Diemen, Netherlands

			.about-content.reveal-on-scroll
				p
					| Hello! My name is <strong>Anton</strong>, and I live in Diemen, Netherlands. I'm deeply passionate about <strong>frontend development and software architecture</strong>. Over the past 15+ years, I have built and delivered high-impact web applications both as a lead/senior engineer in financial institutions and tech companies, and as an independent contractor.

				p
					| My everyday core stack centers around <strong>TypeScript</strong>, <strong>Angular</strong>, <strong>RxJS</strong>, <strong>React.js</strong>, and modern tooling (Vite, Webpack). On the backend, I work with <strong>NestJS</strong> and <strong>Node.js</strong>, and have expanded into backend services with <strong>Kotlin</strong> and <strong>Spring Boot</strong>.

				p
					| Beyond frameworks, I am deeply committed to software craftsmanship: applying <strong>S.O.L.I.D. principles</strong>, design patterns, robust data structures, and creating maintainable, scalable architectures that enable engineering teams to move fast with confidence.

				.about-stats
					.stat-card
						span.stat-card__number 15+
						span.stat-card__label Years Experience
						span.stat-card__desc Web development & engineering
					.stat-card
						span.stat-card__number Platform
						span.stat-card__label Rabobank
						span.stat-card__desc Internal tooling & architecture
					.stat-card
						span.stat-card__number Enterprise
						span.stat-card__label Scale & Quality
						span.stat-card__desc Financial & medical systems
					.stat-card
						span.stat-card__number Full-Stack
						span.stat-card__label Ecosystem
						span.stat-card__desc TS, Node, Kotlin & Spring
